import ../../../testing/driver.dl
import lib/text_scan.dl

appearance group appearance:
    font size is 16
    line spacing is 1.5
    gap is 8

document tabs test:
    tab group "Examples" using group appearance:
        tab "First":
            text surface "First source" containing "First content" using no UI appearance
        tab "Second":
            text surface "Second source" containing "Second content" using no UI appearance
        tab "Third":
            paragraph "Third content" using no UI appearance

set instance to an instance of tabs test
set view to a UI view of (the address of instance) sized 316 by 220 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set group to the control labeled "Examples" in (the address of instance)
require condition ((the active UI editor within group in (the address of instance))'s text = "First source") reporting "The initial tab has no active editor"
require condition (view's control count = 2) reporting "Inactive tabs participated in keyboard traversal"
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at 158.0 18.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 1 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the value of "Examples" in (the address of instance)) = 1) reporting "A tab header did not select its panel"
require condition ((view's window as a pointer to test UI surface)'s drawn contains "Second content") reporting "The selected tab panel was not painted"
set the text of "Second source" in (the address of instance) to "Edited second"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 263 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the value of "Examples" in (the address of instance)) = 0) reporting "Arrow navigation did not select the previous tab"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set the value of "Examples" in (the address of instance) to 1
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the UI value for (the active UI editor within group in (the address of instance)) in (the address of instance))'s text = "Edited second") reporting "Changing tabs discarded the editor's content"
require condition (view's selection's caret source's element = (the active UI editor within group in (the address of instance))) reporting "A programmatic tab switch kept the hidden editor's caret"
close the address of view
close the address of instance
print line "Document tabs share selection, keyboard traversal and persistent editor state."
